	<text xml:lang="la">
		<body>
			<div>
				<p>
					<s n="1" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z1"/>S.</s>
					<s n="2" xml:lang="la">Libenter sane per hunc nuncium, colendissime <lb xml:id="p1z2"/>domine compater, te de Apocalypsi tua certiorem <lb xml:id="p1z3"/>fecissem; sed non fuit possibile.</s>
					<s n="3" xml:lang="la">Fecerunt moram <lb xml:id="p1z4"/>in perlegendo aliqui satis longam; nunc tamen legere <lb xml:id="p1z5"/>omnes.</s>
					<s n="4" xml:lang="la">Ante diem vero lunę aut martis scholarchas <lb xml:id="p1z6"/>cogere non possum.</s>
					<s n="5" xml:lang="la">Impedit etiam, quod e suo podagra <lb xml:id="p1z7"/>iterum decumbit <persName ref="p8018">Hallerus</persName> quęstor, sine cuius opera <lb xml:id="p1z8"/>et praesentia nihil fiet; sed dabit tantum tibi et nobis, ut <lb xml:id="p1z9"/>ad se convocatis scholarchis negotium tandem expediat.</s>
					<s n="6" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z10"/>Spero ergo per proximum nuncium me tibi certa daturum.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="7" xml:lang="la">De obitu <lb xml:id="p1z11"/>praestantissimi, clarissimi et integerrimi viri domini consulis <persName ref="p1888">Lavateri</persName> <lb xml:id="p1z12"/>dolent apud nos quoque pii multi, et condoleo tibi in<lb xml:id="p1z13"/>primis ego, cum non nesciam, qualem, non iam dico <lb xml:id="p1z14"/>affinem, sed in negotio domini fratrem et patronum <lb xml:id="p1z15"/>amiseris.</s>
					<s n="8" xml:lang="la">Dominum oro, ut, quoniam hodie audio <lb xml:id="p1z16"/>comitia consularia futura, substituat alterum, qui <lb xml:id="p1z17"/>ecclesię et reipublicae utilis sit.</s>
					<s n="9" xml:lang="la">Quae misisti, communicavi <lb xml:id="p1z18"/>archigrammatęo, <persName ref="p3494">Diespachio</persName> et quibusdam aliis, a quibus <lb xml:id="p1z19"/>nondum recepi.</s>
					<s n="10" xml:lang="la">Si recepero, antequam nuncius abeat, in<lb xml:id="p1z20"/>cludam hisce; si non recepero, per proximum tamen nuncium <lb xml:id="p1z21"/>remittam.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="11" xml:lang="la">Nihil habemus novi neque ex <placeName ref="l832">Gallia</placeName> neque <lb xml:id="p1z22"/>ex <placeName ref="l834">Italia</placeName> neque etiam ex <placeName ref="l822">Germania</placeName>.</s>
					<s n="12" xml:lang="de">So vil das reißlouffen <lb xml:id="p1z23"/>blanget, ist nitt, das es erloupt; sonder min herren, <lb xml:id="p1z24"/>als si vernommen, das der zug söllen angon, habend <lb xml:id="p1z25"/>sis uff ein nüwes verbotten, und uff das gantz land <lb xml:id="p1z26"/>ußgschriben und an cantzlen verläsen lon.</s>
					<s n="13" xml:lang="la">Hoc <lb xml:id="p1z27"/>tamen verum est, quod nulla certa poena sit constituta, <lb xml:id="p1z28"/><foreign xml:lang="de">sonder bi lyb und guͦt, aber dran ghenckt "nach <lb xml:id="p1z29"/>gstallt der sachen".</foreign></s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="14" xml:lang="la">Quod nos quidem satis mordet, <lb xml:id="p1z30"/>et obtundimus illis aures hac re quotidie; interea tamen <lb xml:id="p1z31"/>verum non est, quod libertas abeundi data sit.</s>
					<s n="15" xml:lang="la">Abiere <lb xml:id="p1z32"/>ex urbe pauci, 4 vel 5, ex quibus duo nobiles <lb xml:id="p1z33"/>familię <placeName>Erlacensis</placeName>, et cum his quęstoris <persName ref="p4639">Dilgeri</persName> filius; <lb xml:id="p1z34"/>sed praetexunt eos tantum castra videre velle et mox <lb xml:id="p1z35"/>redituros.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="16" xml:lang="la">Haec ad tuas raptim.</s>
					<s n="17" xml:lang="la"><persName ref="p8292">Zebedaeus</persName> hic <lb xml:id="p1z36"/>est; quid moliatur aut agat, nescio.</s>
					<s n="18" xml:lang="la">Me non convenit; <lb xml:id="p1z37"/>in platea forte in ipsum incidi.</s>
					<s n="19" xml:lang="la" ana="salute">Mater, uxor <lb xml:id="p1z38"/>et mei omnes te tuosque salutant.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="20" xml:lang="la"><placeName ref="l41">Bernae</placeName> 16. <lb xml:id="p1z39"/>ianuarii 1557.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="21" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z40"/><persName ref="p8018">Hallerus</persName> tuus.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<note type="address">[Adresse:]</note>
					<s n="22" xml:lang="la"><pb/><lb xml:id="p2z1"/>Clarissimo viro d. <persName ref="p495">Heinrycho <lb xml:id="p2z2"/>Bullingero</persName>, <placeName ref="l587">Tigurinae</placeName> <lb xml:id="p2z3"/>ecclesiae pastori fidelissimo, domino <lb xml:id="p2z4"/>et compatri colendissimo <lb xml:id="p2z5"/>et charissimo suo.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<note type="author">[Darunter von <persName ref="p495">Bullingers</persName> Hand:]</note>
					<s n="23" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p2z6"/>16. ianuarii <lb xml:id="p2z7"/>1557.</s>
				</p>
